Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:06.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hi! In this quick video, I'll show you how to report a no-show from the Job Admin page.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:11.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,First, find the job under Pending Invoice Jobs, and click its Job ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:14.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,That opens up the Job Admin page.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,From here, click Do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:22.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,Scroll down to the No Show section, and click the red Submit No Show button.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:31.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,And there you go. The job now shows as cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:41.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,Now, close the Job Admin page, and refresh your CRM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:52.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Pending Invoice job is gone, and it now shows as cancelled in the CRM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's it! Easy, right?
